  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n(79, 58, 62)\n\n__(58 + 62)__ ÷ 2 + 19 = 79 \n\n__**120 ÷**____** 2**__ + 19 = 79\n\n__**60 + 19**__ = 79\n\n79 = 79 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n(54, 33, 37)\n\n__(33 + 37)__ ÷ 2 + 19 = 54 \n\n__70 ÷____ 2__ + 19 = 54\n\n__35 + 19__ = 54\n\n54 = 54 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo, checking each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) (59, 33, 43)\n\n__(33 + 43)__ ÷ 2 + 19 = 59 \n\n__76 ÷____ 2__ + 19 = 59\n\n__38 + 19__ = 59\n\n57 ≠ 59 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) (47, 36, 41)\n\n__(36 + 41)__ ÷ 2 + 19 = 47 \n\n__77 ÷____ 2__ + 19 = 47\n\n__38.5 + 19__ = 47\n\n57.5 ≠ 47 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) (66, 45, 49)\n\n__(45 + 49)__ ÷ 2 + 19 = 66 \n\n__94 ÷____ 2__ + 19 = 66\n\n__47 + 19__ = 66\n\n**66 = 66 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 4) (43, 25, 30)\n\n__(25 + 30)__ ÷ 2 + 19 = 43 \n\n__55 ÷____ 2__ + 19 = 43\n\n__47.5 + 19__ = 43\n\n66.5 ≠ 43 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nThus, out of all the options, '(66, 45, 49)' follows the same logic as given.\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
